This repository contains deployment configuration only.

OpenStatus (https://github.com/openstatusHQ/openstatus) is AGPL-3.0 and is
pulled as upstream container images; none of its code is vendored here except
the Tinybird project, which images/tinybird-deploy downloads at build time.

images/tinybird-local, images/tinybird-deploy and images/cron/os-admin are
adapted from ephraimduncan/openstatus-railway (MIT, per its README), which
worked out Tinybird Local's thread limits on Railway and the os-admin toolbox.
Changes here: pinned versions, the `auto` command, and the limits set.
